{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A clicker game with great music where every choice you make can change the gameplay. There is also an auto-clicker\u2014you don\u2019t need to use the mouse, but you might miss out on discovering all the game\u2019s secrets (all achievements can be earned with the auto-clicker).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game now features an item economy: each item has its own drop rate, and rare items can be traded and collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes professional multi-voice female voice acting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades, skins, and prestiges. Once you reach over 1,000 prestiges, you can unlock a secret upgrade! Stay tuned for future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy skins (Skyline, Reversed Skyline, Skyline Logo, My Photo and nothing)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy upgrades (Engine, Sky, Skai, Wheels, Something, Extra Car)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Skyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to music (adjustable volume)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy prestiges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item economy with a drop and trading system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WORKSHOP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cases</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for new updates!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First click!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505930/f6d8ddd424add0c313a2f2ea2f7caa525ddd7b43.jpg"},{"name":"SKYLINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505930/8796381e959461a47e1906c8403a43febe9fc098.jpg"},{"name":"New Game!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3505930/f6d8ddd424add0c313a2f2ea